	(text "U2 config (TPS63900 Table 7-2/7-3, read once at start-up):\n  SEL = GND -> VO(1) set by R3 on CFG3: 16.2k 1% = 3.3 V\n  CFG1 = CFG2 = 0R -> input current limit UNLIMITED (VO(2) unused)\n  L1 2.2 uH Isat >= 2 A, C1 10 uF in, C2 22 uF out (+22 uF at U1)\nQ1: drain to battery, source to load, gate to GND. Reversed cell -> body diode\n  blocks and Vgs = 0. Rds(on) 41 mOhm @ -1.8 V. No quiescent current.\nJP1: bridged by default; cut and fit a 2-pin header to measure the sleep current."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 13.97 66.04 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "63b02ce6-5845-598f-9d9e-191d7cd1baae")
	)
