	(text "VBAT_SENSE = VBAT_P / 2 when Q2 is on (VBAT_MEAS_EN = 1).\nQ2 off -> no current path; VBAT_SENSE sits at VBAT_P (<= 3.3 V for CR123A) through R4.\nSettling: tau = (R4||R5) * C4 = 5 ms -> wait >= 30 ms before sampling.\nR6 keeps Q2 off while GPIO0 floats (reset, light-sleep with TOP power-down).\nDivider current while measuring: 16.5 uA for ~30 ms, a few times per day."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 96.52 101.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9a648490-ea85-5d8f-8a45-fcb71df28014")
	)
